      "Should minimize total action steps compared to alternative heuristics."
    ]
  },
  "warrant": "The incumbent's reliance on a semantic prior (fridge) followed by exhaustive closed-storage scanning resulted in a long trajectory. It is unresolved whether a policy excluding closed storage or prioritizing 'trash' as a potential food source would yield better performance, making this comparison worth opening for C to test."
